{"q":"70","t":"Climbing Stairs","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>You are climbing a staircase. It takes <code>n</code> steps to reach the top.</p>\n\n<p>Each time you can either climb <code>1</code> or <code>2</code> steps. In how many distinct ways can you climb to the top?</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 2\n<strong>Output:</strong> 2\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> There are two ways to climb to the top.\n1. 1 step + 1 step\n2. 2 steps\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 3\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> There are three ways to climb to the top.\n1. 1 step + 1 step + 1 step\n2. 1 step + 2 steps\n3. 2 steps + 1 step\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 45</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":["To reach nth step, what could have been your previous steps? (Think about the step sizes)"],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"climbStairs\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"n\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"},{"name":"Memoization","slug":"memoization"}],"s":[{"t":"Min Cost Climbing Stairs","s":"min-cost-climbing-stairs","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Fibonacci Number","s":"fibonacci-number","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"N-th Tribonacci Number","s":"n-th-tribonacci-number","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Minimum Rounds to Complete All Tasks","s":"minimum-rounds-to-complete-all-tasks","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Number of Ways to Place Houses","s":"count-number-of-ways-to-place-houses","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Number of Ways to Reach a Position After Exactly k Steps","s":"number-of-ways-to-reach-a-position-after-exactly-k-steps","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Ways To Build Good Strings","s":"count-ways-to-build-good-strings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Frog Jump II","s":"frog-jump-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find Number of Ways to Reach the K-th Stair","s":"find-number-of-ways-to-reach-the-k-th-stair","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"The Number of Ways to Make the Sum","s":"the-number-of-ways-to-make-the-sum","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Intuit","intuit"],["tcs","tcs"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Qualcomm","qualcomm"],["Accenture","accenture"],["Grammarly","grammarly"],["Rakuten","rakuten"],["Media.net","medianet"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["IBM","ibm"],["Agoda","agoda"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Accolite","accolite"],["PayPal","paypal"],["Deloitte","deloitte"],["ByteDance","bytedance"],["Josh Technology","josh-technology"],["Apple","apple"],["Adobe","adobe"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",15],["Amazon","amazon",11],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",6],["Microsoft","microsoft",5],["Meta","facebook",4],["Infosys","infosys",4],["tcs","tcs",2],["Intuit","intuit",2]],"b":[["Deloitte","deloitte",2]],"m":[["Accenture","accenture",12],["Grammarly","grammarly",12],["Zoho","zoho",11],["TikTok","tiktok",8],["IBM","ibm",4],["Apple","apple",4],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",4],["Oracle","oracle",3],["Nvidia","nvidia",3],["Cognizant","cognizant",3]]}}